e data such as `{:doc \"x\"}`: `:yin.k/non-portable` kind\n----\n2:134:**Identity rows** are cursor cells (UCF §7.5.3, \"Terminology: cursor,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01T3Kpod35SJjY1kjcr2DAtx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
